    "created_at": "2015-09-04T18:15:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-04T18:15:11Z",
    "body": "How can you not say live HTML collections are bad? They are super-confusing for authors, who don't expect array-like things to change out from under them (e.g. while iterating them).\n",
